DESCRIPTION:A riveting discussion with the authors of the award-winning bo
 ok\, “The Jailhouse Lawyer.” Winner of the ABA’s 2026 Silver Gavel A
 ward. John Grisham described the book as “so incredible it strains belie
 f.” Come learn more about Calvin’s 28-year struggle to secure his rel
