  that helps participants better understand how government works\, why civi
 c engagement matters\, and how individuals can create change in their comm
 unities. Through engaging discussions and real-world examples\, families w
 ill explore the foundations of civics in a welcoming and accessible enviro
 nment.\nCategory: Books\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/c
 ivics-4-all-ages/
