BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Dynamic! – Funny scenes\, songs and games! — Atlanta
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261121T220000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261121T233000
DTSTAMP:20261108T221058Z
UID:298bedecf110087d6473f14df1f1@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Theater\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:The Dynamic! is an improv show that thrives on chaos\, quick t
 hinking\, and whatever ideas the audience throws at the cast. Every scene
 \, game\, and musical moment is built in real time\, and the performers le
 an into the unexpected with a mix of confidence\, silliness\, and genuine 
 surprise. They know how to turn a wild suggestion or a joke that goes off 
 the rails into something even funnier\, and half the joy is watching them 
 navigate the mess together. The show moves fast\, the energy stays high\, 
 and no two nights ever feel the same. You help spark the fun\, and the cas
 t runs with it to create a comedy experience that feels alive\, loose\, an
 d completely in the moment.\nCategory: Theater\nOriginal listing: https://
 www.artsatl.org/event/the-dynamic-funny-scenes-songs-and-games-5/2026-11-2
 1/
LOCATION:Dynamic El Dorado\, 572 Edgewood Ave SE #116\, Atlanta\, 30312
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/the-dynamic-funny-scenes-songs-and-games
 -5/2026-11-21/
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:artsatl
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Oglethorpe Theatre presents Cyrano De Bergerac — Atlanta
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261122T140000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261122T160000
DTSTAMP:20261108T221058Z
UID:30a8a3793a8978ae3ce951832db9@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Theater\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:A genius with language\, Cyrano secretly loves the radiant Rox
 ane\, but she loves the beautiful but inarticulate Christian. Convinced of
  his own ugliness\, Cyrano offers to act as a go-between and writes beauti
 ful love letters for Christian to give to Roxane. This verbal deception se
 ts in motion a poignant and often hilarious love triangle in which each ch
 aracter is torn between the lure of physical attraction and the seductive 
 power of words. Martin Crimp’s radical adaptation reimagines the classic
  love story through spoken word\, contemporary poetry and rap—creating a
  world where words are everything.\nCategory: Theater\nOriginal listing: h
 ttps://www.artsatl.org/event/oglethorpe-theatre-presents-cyrano-de-bergera
 c/2026-11-22/
LOCATION:Conant Performing Arts Center at Oglethorpe University\, 4484 Pea
 chtree Rd NE\, Atlanta\, GA\, 30319
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/oglethorpe-theatre-presents-cyrano-de-be
 rgerac/2026-11-22/
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:artsatl
END:VEVENT
