CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Music\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:CRAZY CHESTER – Crazy Chester is the Carrboro\, NC tribute t
 o The Band and The Last Waltz. Started in 2020 as a one-off set in Raleigh
 \, NC\, the quintet has grown organically in the years since while still c
 entering the wealth of musicianship and camaraderie in the Triangle region
  of NC. Their care and attention to detail – from the instrumentation an
 d horn charts to attire and presentation\, without gimmicks – is a testa
 ment to the shared sense of duty to honor all members of The Band and thei
 r enduring legacy. All five members are formidable musicians in their own 
 right: Charles Cleaver (Garth Hudson / keys\, accordion\, vocals) plays in
  such venerated groups as Fancy Gap\, Scivic Rivers\, and wi\nCategory: Mu
 sic\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/crazy-chester-a-very-
 nc-tribute-to-the-band-the-last-waltz-50th-anniversary-tour-w-wild-angels-
 the-garden-club/
LOCATION:The Garden Club at Wild Heaven West End\, 1010 White St SW\, Atla
 nta\, GA\, 30310
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/crazy-chester-a-very-nc-tribute-to-the-b
 and-the-last-waltz-50th-anniversary-tour-w-wild-angels-the-garden-club/
