  223 James P Brawley Drive SW\, Atlanta\, 30314
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/infinite-pasts-and-ancestral-futures-the
 -murals-of-hale-woodruff-and-john-biggers/
